WEBVTT

00:04:29.015 --> 00:04:31.100
In her more dramatic
moments, she would say,

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.145
"John, if I ever get
that sick, just shoot me.

00:04:34.186 --> 00:04:35.396
Just shoot me."

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:40.568
And John Rinka would look
lovingly at his wife, his healthy wife,

00:04:40.609 --> 00:04:41.861
and he would say,

00:04:41.902 --> 00:04:43.779
"OK, Steph. OK."

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.491
Fast-forward a couple of decades.

00:04:47.533 --> 00:04:51.787
In her late fifties,
Stephanie begins to slur her words.

00:04:52.872 --> 00:04:55.624
She goes to see a doctor,
who runs some tests,

00:04:55.666 --> 00:05:00.004
and he diagnoses her with ALS,
Lou Gehrig's disease.